        "claim_kind": "FACT",
        "claim_text": "Those reported figures describe total capital expenditure. They provide no separate AI-only spending measure, so assigning the cash result to a specific AI investment change would exceed their scope. The retained figures also leave the timing, composition and efficiency of that investment unresolved.",
