        "claim_kind": "CAUSALITY",
        "claim_text": "The serious countercase is that operating cash may also have strengthened. If that improvement accompanied the reported investment increase, positive free cash flow could be more durable than a spending-only reading suggests. The supplied record leaves that explanation open; it does not justify dismissing the result as a timing effect.",
